            "review_title": "Review at Air Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "2000Patrick_81\nRotterdam, The Netherlands9 contributions\n0\nNice view and relaxing atmosphere\nMar 2017 • Couples\nThis bar is on top of the Blossom City Hotel. We spent several evenings there. Drinks are good. There was also a happy hour 1+1. Food was ok but not great. It was normally pretty empty, most of the time we were the only guests. But the best thing is of course the view of the river and bridges.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 9, 2017\nTabinoHotelDanang\nThanks for your advice. Hope next time will welcome you with better quality.Looking forward to serving you next time, when you return to Da Nang. See you next time. Thanks for support.\nWritten July 10, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
