            "review_title": "Review at Air Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "C3325OIangell\nHong Kong, China33 contributions\n0\nNice city view from the restaurant on the 11/F.\nJan 2017 • Family\nWide range of breakfast buffet.\nDelicious Vietnamese and western cruise.\nFree pho is provided at night from 2100-2300.\nWritten January 6, 2017\nTabinoHotelDanang\nDear guest,\n\nMany thanks for taking the time to share your review following your experience with our restaurant & bar.\n\nIt is brilliant to hear that you enjoyed our buffet breakfast and our late-night Pho.\n\nWe hope that we will be able to welcome you back to The Blossom City Hotel and Air Restaurant & Bar.\n\nBest regards,\nYaginuma Yuki\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten January 23, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
