            "review_title": "Review at Air Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "Tim S\nCebu Island, Philippines51 contributions\n0\nBest people on earth\nDec 2016 • Solo\nI have traveled to 60+ countries & have never been treated so warmly & friendly as the entire staff at this restaurant, bar & hotel\nThis is my 2nd night here I was only going to stay 1 day but these people are the salt of the earth. Now more like friends then staff. I have enjoyed the drinks, food, & my new friends.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 12, 2016\nTabinoHotelDanang\nDear Tim,\n\nMany thanks for taking the time to share your review following your experience with our hotel, as well as the restaurant & bar.\n\nIt is brilliant to hear that you enjoyed everything we offer here, from the food, the drinks to the excellent service from the staff.\n\nWe hope that we will be able to welcome you back to The Blossom City Hotel and Air Restaurant & Bar.\n\nBest regards,\nYaginuma Yuki\nGeneral Manager\nRead more\nWritten January 23, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
